  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "閒置空間再利用",
    "sub_ename": "ADAPTIVE REUSE OF VACANT SPACES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程闡述建築閒置空間再利用的理論與設計策略，並介紹國內外閒置空間再利用的案例，引導學生從社會活動面、經營管理面、結構修繕面、環境整合面來進行建築空間的再生與活化。",
    "describe_eh": "This course expounds the theory and design strategy of the reuse of building space, and introduces domestic and international cases of unused space reusing. It also provides building reuse issues from the aspects of social activities, operational management, structural improvement and environmental integration.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
